---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import PageTitle from '../../components/PageTitle.astro'
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'

const title = 'Project Overview'
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <PageTitle title={title} />
  <p class="text-lg mb-10">
    In democratic institutions and organizations, decision-making power is
    spread amongst the members.
    <br />
    However, executive power often ends up in the hands of a few digital vanguards
    or those with the technical know-how to work the technology of the organization.
    <br />
    If these digital vanguards were to go rogue, they could use their power to harm
    the organization itself.
    <br /><br />
    Consider the case of Parliament.
    <br />
    Networks in Parliament are run by administrators who may support a particular
    party. If these admins were to go rogue, national secrets or fair elections may
    be at risk.
    <br />
    <br />
    This academic research project investigates novel approaches to access control
    systems, focusing on democratization, transparency, and distributed decision making.
    <br />
    It seeks to protect democratic institutions and organizations from potential rogue
    insiders.
  </p>
  <section
    class="hero py-6 px-8 my-6 bg-linear-25 from-slate-100 to-slate-200 rounded-2xl"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center">
      <Icon name="target" class={'text-xl mr-2 text-slate-900'} />
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Research Objectives</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="mt-4">
      <li class="flex items-center text-lg mb-3">
        <Icon name="logo" class={'mr-2 text-slate-900'} />
        Analyze current access control models and their susceptibility to malicious
        insider attacks
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center text-lg mb-3">
        <Icon name="logo" class={'mr-2 text-slate-900'} />Develop access control
        models based on participatory vote
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center text-lg mb-3">
        <Icon name="logo" class={'mr-2 text-slate-900'} />Investigate the impact
        of reputation on voting procedures
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center text-lg mb-3">
        <Icon name="logo" class={'mr-2 text-slate-900'} />Determine the
        usability of voting-based access control models
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="flex flex-wrap py-6 my-6">
    <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
      <div class="px-8 py-6 mt-6 md:mr-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <Icon name="flask" class={'text-xl mr-2 text-slate-900'} />
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Methodology</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg">
          Our research employs mixed methods including technical analysis, case
          studies, stakeholder interviews, and system design and implementation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
      <div class="px-8 py-6 mt-6 md:ml-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <Icon name="timeline" class={'text-xl mr-2 text-slate-900'} />
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Timeline</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg">
          The project spans 10 months, divided into five phases: literature
          review, security proofs, system development, usability testing, and
          dissemination.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="hero py-6 px-8 my-6 bg-linear-25 from-slate-50 to-slate-100 rounded-2xl"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center">
      <Icon name="goal" class={'text-xl mr-2 text-slate-900'} />
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Expected Outcomes</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap mt-4 ml-6">
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <ul>
          <li class="list-disc text-lg mb-3">
            Open-source access control framework
          </li>
          <li class="list-disc text-lg mb-3">Peer-reviewed publications</li>
          <li class="list-disc text-lg mb-3">Masters Theses</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <ul>
          <li class="list-disc text-lg mb-3">Conference presentations</li>
          <li class="list-disc text-lg mb-3">Stakeholder engagement</li>
          <li class="list-disc text-lg mb-3">Future research directions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
